+*   `VX_SKY_LUT_HEIGHT`: 400 [S1, unofficial].
+*   `VX_SKY_SOLAR_RADIUS_RAD`: Angular radius of the sun disk in radians. Used to compute `cos_theta_max` [S1, unofficial].
